    "body": "Merged main to resolve a conflict with #505 (Siemens safe retract from the machine file). Both touched `sinumerik.cps` onClose. They now combine: the program-end `G53 Z` lift uses #505's stated `safeZ()` and is skipped when a trailing trip home was the last thing written (#504). The trip home already lifts to the same safe Z.\n- **Re-gated:** app `program_entry` 10, `sinumerik_safe_retract`, `tormach_safe_retract`, `conformance`, `posting`, `after_op` and `per_op_files` pass, as do all camcraft-post tests. Clippy is clean.\n- **Draft cycle:** turned back to draft for the push and flagged ready again.",
